I'm now focused on the UI elements for custom preset management, specifically the "Save as Preset" and preset deletion features. I will add the "Save Preset" button next to the "Add" button and will render custom presets separately from default presets. I plan to add the delete button, the "x", to the custom presets specifically. Finally, I will structure `LyricsTab.tsx` in this way.


