I've decided on the UI layout and now I'm building it in the code. There will be an input row with an input field and "Add" and "Save as Preset" buttons. Then, the presets will be displayed in two rows, one for default presets and one for custom presets with delete buttons. I'm also implementing the "Save as Preset" button. The custom presets will visually distinguished by border color or style.

